{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07599","headline":"蒙山作 · 萧颖士","name":"蒙山作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东蒙镇海沂，合沓余百里。\n清秋净氛霭，崖崿隐天起。\n于役劳往还，息徒暂攀跻。\n将穷绝迹处，偶得冥心理。\n云气杂虹霓，松声乱风水。\n微明绿林际，杳窱丹洞里。\n仙鸟时可闻，羽人邈难视。\n此焉多深邃，贤达昔所止。\n子尚捐俗纷，季随蹑遐轨。\n蕴真道弥旷，怀古情未已。\n白鹿凡几游，黄精复奚似。\n顾予尚牵缠，家业重书史。\n少学务从师，壮年贵趋仕。\n方驰桂林誉，未暇桃源美。\n岁暮期再寻，幽哉羡门子。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"萧颖士","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07599.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07599","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}